  "notes": "USAGE:\n{捕食|ほしょく} is a scientific/ecological term primarily used in biology and nature documentaries. It is not used for human eating. The word appears frequently in discussions of food chains and animal behavior.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {捕食|ほしょく}{者|しゃ}: predator\n- {捕食|ほしょく}{行動|こうどう}: predatory behavior\n- {捕食|ほしょく}{関係|かんけい}: predator-prey relationship\n- {天敵|てんてき}に{捕食|ほしょく}される: to be preyed upon by a natural enemy",
